flowchart LR
  U[User terminal] --> CLI[rakazo login: loopback listener]
  CLI -->|opens authorize URL| PAGE[GET /cli/authorize: session-authed page]
  PAGE -->|Allow| SRV[API: create CliToken row, store SHA-256 hash]
  PAGE -->|Deny / close| CLI_FAIL[CLI exit 3 AUTH_FAILED]
  SRV -->|POST 127.0.0.1 callback once, raw token| CLI
  CLI --> STORE[(~/.config/rakazo credentials 0600)]
  STORE -->|Bearer CliToken| RPC[all RPC: chat, steer, attach...]
  SRV --> ACTOR[actor resolution: session OR token hash -> Actor]
  WEB[Settings panel] -->|rpc.cliTokens.list/revoke| SRV
